    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Ravenloft Campaign)</em></p><p>Memories from a past or alternate life echo through you. You gain the following features.</p><p><strong>Channeled Prowess.</strong> You gain proficiency in two skills of your choice. In addition, choose one skill in which you have proficiency: you have Expertise in that skill. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can change the skill you chose for this Expertise.</p><p><strong>Inherent Tongues.</strong> You know one additional language of your choice from the Player's Handbook language tables.</p><p><strong>Intrusive Echoes.</strong> Immediately after you roll a 1 on the d20 of a D20 Test, the memories and sensations of your soul's other life threaten to overwhelm you. Make a Constitution saving throw (DC 13 plus your Proficiency Bonus). On a failure, you have the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated] condition until the end of your next turn, and your Speed is halved while you're Incapacitated this way.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-oA8JGr2S08D7gpTa\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>To change the Expertise after a Long Rest, edit the skills on your sheet. <em>Intrusive Echoes</em> is a Constitution saving throw against DC 13 + your Proficiency Bonus; on a failure, apply its effect (Incapacitated, Speed halved).</p></section>",
